│ patch_description        │ This crossover keeps the stronger broad dirty-cell targeting strategy from the current    │
│                          │ program while incorporating exact cheapest-detour insertion from the inspiration program. │
│                          │ It also replaces the expensive nested visit-time vectors and repeated route validation    │
│                          │ with a flat route representation, precomputed adjacency/APSP parents, and O(L) gap-based  │
│                          │ scoring. This allows substantially more simulated-annealing iterations within the same    │
│                          │ time limit while preserving legal cyclic routes.                                          │
