│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ targeted_cycle_operations                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ Improve two route-edit operations that currently spend substantial search effort on weak  │
│                          │ or invalid candidates.                                                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Operation 4 selects a high-dirt target that is guaranteed to already occur somewhere   │
│                          │ in the route. The previous implementation samples only 20 route positions, usually        │
│                          │ missing that exact occurrence and adding a long out-and-back detour. By locating an       │
│                          │ existing visit to the target, the operation always adds a length-2 wiggle at that cell.   │
│                          │ This directly increases cleaning frequency for the selected problematic cell with the     │
│                          │ minimum possible route-length increase.                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. Operation 3 previously reverses and inverts an arbitrary segment. Such a transformed   │
│                          │ segment goes from the old segment endpoint back to its start, so it is generally invalid  │
│                          │ unless both endpoints are the same cell. Restricting it to closed subpaths makes every    │
│                          │ proposed reversal legal and turns a mostly wasted operation into a useful timing/order    │
│                          │ perturbation.                                                                             │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
