│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ gap_split_patrol                                                                          │
│ patch_description        │ This approach replaces route-level simulated annealing with a constructive cyclic patrol  │
│                          │ optimizer.                                                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ It first builds several DFS-based valid covering tours. Then it repeatedly analyzes the   │
│                          │ largest revisit gap of every cell. Cells with high dirt susceptibility and long gaps are  │
│                          │ prioritized. For a selected cell, the algorithm inserts a shortest-path round trip from   │
│                          │ the temporal midpoint of that cell’s worst gap, directly splitting the expensive gap into │
│                          │ two smaller ones.                                                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Because the dirt objective grows quadratically with revisit intervals, splitting the      │
│                          │ largest weighted gaps is a targeted way to reduce score. Several candidate insertions are │
│                          │ evaluated exactly, and only score-improving modifications are retained. This avoids       │
│                          │ expensive random route mutation while focusing computation on the dominant dirt           │
│                          │ contributions.                                                                            │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
